{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function listVoices<TAdapter>(options): Promise<ListVoicesResult>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/generateSpeech/index.ts#L453","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/generateSpeech/index.ts:453"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"List the voices an account can pass to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"generateSpeech()"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Only providers with a per-account catalog implement this. A provider whose\nvoices are a fixed list publishes that list as a const in its package, so\nimport it from there rather than calling this."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tadapter","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TAdapter"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TAdapter"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/TTSAdapter.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TTSAdapter"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TTSProviderOptions"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TAdapter"},{"type":"text","value":">>"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"options"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ListVoicesActivityOptions"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TAdapter"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Promise"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/ListVoicesResult.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ListVoicesResult"}]},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Find the voices you created"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { listVoices } from '@tanstack/ai'\nimport { elevenlabsSpeech } from '@tanstack/ai-elevenlabs'\n\nconst { voices } = await listVoices({\n  adapter: elevenlabsSpeech('eleven_v4'),\n  origins: ['generated', 'cloned'],\n})","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tadapter","text":"TAdapter","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"options","text":"options","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction listVoices<TAdapter>(options): Promise<ListVoicesResult>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/generateSpeech/index.ts:453](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/generateSpeech/index.ts#L453)\n\nList the voices an account can pass to `generateSpeech()`.\n\nOnly providers with a per-account catalog implement this. A provider whose\nvoices are a fixed list publishes that list as a const in its package, so\nimport it from there rather than calling this.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TAdapter\n\n`TAdapter` *extends* [`TTSAdapter`](../interfaces/TTSAdapter.md)\\<`string`, `TTSProviderOptions`\\<`TAdapter`\\>\\>\n\n## Parameters\n\n### options\n\n`ListVoicesActivityOptions`\\<`TAdapter`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<[`ListVoicesResult`](../interfaces/ListVoicesResult.md)\\>\n\n## Example\n\n**Find the voices you created**\n\n```ts\nimport { listVoices } from '@tanstack/ai'\nimport { elevenlabsSpeech } from '@tanstack/ai-elevenlabs'\n\nconst { voices } = await listVoices({\n  adapter: elevenlabsSpeech('eleven_v4'),\n  origins: ['generated', 'cloned'],\n})\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: listVoices\ntitle: listVoices\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction listVoices<TAdapter>(options): Promise<ListVoicesResult>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/generateSpeech/index.ts:453](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/generateSpeech/index.ts#L453)\n\nList the voices an account can pass to `generateSpeech()`.\n\nOnly providers with a per-account catalog implement this. A provider whose\nvoices are a fixed list publishes that list as a const in its package, so\nimport it from there rather than calling this.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TAdapter\n\n`TAdapter` *extends* [`TTSAdapter`](../interfaces/TTSAdapter.md)\\<`string`, `TTSProviderOptions`\\<`TAdapter`\\>\\>\n\n## Parameters\n\n### options\n\n`ListVoicesActivityOptions`\\<`TAdapter`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<[`ListVoicesResult`](../interfaces/ListVoicesResult.md)\\>\n\n## Example\n\n**Find the voices you created**\n\n```ts\nimport { listVoices } from '@tanstack/ai'\nimport { elevenlabsSpeech } from '@tanstack/ai-elevenlabs'\n\nconst { voices } = await listVoices({\n  adapter: elevenlabsSpeech('eleven_v4'),\n  origins: ['generated', 'cloned'],\n})\n```\n"}
